{"body": [{"y0": 65.1, "x0": 141.4, "x1": 396.1, "text": "litteràs legere. Süme tabulam tuam et scribe H litteram"}, {"y0": 83.8, "x0": 141.0, "x1": 177.4, "text": "decies!\""}, {"y0": 101.8, "x0": 152.2, "x1": 414.3, "text": "Marcus decies H scribit HHHHHHHHH H. Tum 1I"}, {"y0": 120.3, "x0": 141.2, "x1": 415.4, "text": "magister eum V sexies scribere iubet, et Màrcus, qui 120"}, {"y0": 138.0, "x0": 141.2, "x1": 395.2, "text": "eandem litteram toties scribere nón vult, V V V v scribit."}, {"y0": 155.8, "x0": 141.2, "x1": 395.7, "text": "Quotiés Marcus v scribit? Marcus, ut piger discipulus,"}, {"y0": 174.9, "x0": 141.0, "x1": 396.1, "text": "quater tantum V scribit. Deinde magister eum tótum"}, {"y0": 193.1, "x0": 141.0, "x1": 395.9, "text": "vocabulum NASVM quinquies scribere iubet, et Marcus"}, {"y0": 211.6, "x0": 141.0, "x1": 414.6, "text": "Scribit NASVM NASVM NASVM NASV NASV. Márcus ter 125"}, {"y0": 229.8, "x0": 141.0, "x1": 256.6, "text": "récte et bis pràve scribit."}, {"y0": 247.8, "x0": 151.8, "x1": 395.0, "text": "Tum Titus, qui duas litteràs deesse videt, sic incipit:"}, {"y0": 265.4, "x0": 140.9, "x1": 395.9, "text": "*Magister! Marcus bis...\" — cum Marcus stilum dü-"}, {"y0": 284.5, "x0": 141.0, "x1": 395.9, "text": "rum in partem corporis eius mollissimam premit! Titus"}, {"y0": 302.5, "x0": 141.0, "x1": 414.6, "text": "tacet nec finem sententiae facere audet. Magister véró 130"}, {"y0": 320.9, "x0": 140.9, "x1": 243.1, "text": "hoc non animadvertit."}, {"y0": 338.9, "x0": 151.8, "x1": 371.4, "text": "Magister: Iam tótam sententiam recte scribe!\""}, {"y0": 357.0, "x0": 151.8, "x1": 292.2, "text": "Marcus interrogat: Quoties?\""}, {"y0": 375.6, "x0": 151.5, "x1": 329.5, "text": "Magister breviter respondet: \"Semel.\""}, {"y0": 393.8, "x0": 151.7, "x1": 414.5, "text": "Marcus tótam sententiam iterum ab initio scribere 135"}, {"y0": 411.9, "x0": 140.7, "x1": 257.7, "text": "incipit: HOMO HOCVLOS..."}, {"y0": 429.8, "x0": 151.7, "x1": 395.7, "text": "Magister: *Quid significat hoculos? Illud vocabulum"}, {"y0": 448.5, "x0": 140.7, "x1": 237.7, "text": "turpe non intellego!\""}, {"y0": 466.8, "x0": 151.5, "x1": 345.5, "text": "Marcus: Num hic quoque littera deest?\""}, {"y0": 484.8, "x0": 151.5, "x1": 415.0, "text": "Magister: \"Immo véró nón deest, at superest H litte- 140"}, {"y0": 502.8, "x0": 140.5, "x1": 263.4, "text": "ra! Num tü hoculós dicis?\""}, {"y0": 521.2, "x0": 151.5, "x1": 395.6, "text": "Marcus, ut puer improbus, magistro verba sua red-"}, {"y0": 539.6, "x0": 140.5, "x1": 375.2, "text": "dit: ^Nón semper dicimus idem atque scribimus!\""}], "margin": [{"y0": 85.6, "x0": 39.2, "x1": 85.1, "text": "deciés 2 10x"}, {"y0": 103.1, "x0": 39.9, "x1": 68.3, "text": "-ies [x]:"}, {"y0": 112.2, "x0": 43.9, "x1": 94.8, "text": "quoties? totis:"}, {"y0": 121.6, "x0": 43.9, "x1": 89.6, "text": "decies 2 10x"}, {"y0": 131.0, "x0": 44.0, "x1": 86.3, "text": "novies 2 9x"}, {"y0": 140.0, "x0": 43.9, "x1": 83.8, "text": "Octiés — 8x"}, {"y0": 149.0, "x0": 43.9, "x1": 87.4, "text": "sepues — 7x"}, {"y0": 158.0, "x0": 43.9, "x1": 84.4, "text": "sexies — 6x"}, {"y0": 167.1, "x0": 43.5, "x1": 98.9, "text": "quinquies — 5x"}, {"y0": 176.3, "x0": 43.5, "x1": 87.4, "text": "quater — 4x"}, {"y0": 185.1, "x0": 43.7, "x1": 74.1, "text": "ter — 3x"}, {"y0": 194.3, "x0": 43.7, "x1": 74.8, "text": "bis — 2x"}, {"y0": 203.7, "x0": 43.7, "x1": 84.7, "text": "semel 2 1x"}, {"y0": 222.9, "x0": 63.1, "x1": 66.0, "text": "f"}, {"y0": 223.3, "x0": 50.3, "x1": 74.3, "text": "| [S6"}, {"y0": 237.3, "x0": 47.6, "x1": 52.7, "text": "("}, {"y0": 267.9, "x0": 65.6, "x1": 83.5, "text": "E, 7"}, {"y0": 273.3, "x0": 49.3, "x1": 116.2, "text": "| MEC"}, {"y0": 297.1, "x0": 58.1, "x1": 115.1, "text": "LISESAN"}, {"y0": 321.9, "x0": 38.8, "x1": 122.7, "text": "animadvertere — vidére"}, {"y0": 330.9, "x0": 43.1, "x1": 77.7, "text": "vel audire"}, {"y0": 376.8, "x0": 38.8, "x1": 79.9, "text": "semel — 1x"}, {"y0": 486.3, "x0": 38.6, "x1": 114.2, "te